---
// Conteúdo da seção "How It Works"
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold uppercase">A FULL ARSENAL AT YOUR COMMAND</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-foreground/70">
      PostPulsar V2 is more than a repurposing tool. It's a complete content
      operations center.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background/30 p-8 text-center"
    >
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-primary"
      >
        1
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">Input Source</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-foreground/70">
        Provide a blog post URL or simply paste the raw text. Our system
        extracts the core message.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background/30 p-8 text-center"
    >
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-primary"
      >
        2
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">Generate Content</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-foreground/70">
        Our AI generates a variety of posts, threads, and summaries, including
        text, images, and video content.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background/30 p-8 text-center"
    >
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-primary"
      >
        3
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">Review & Publish</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-foreground/70">
        Fine-tune the generated content and publish it directly to all your
        connected social networks with one click.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-20 text-center">
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase">Key Capabilities</h3>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-foreground/70">
      Explore the powerful features that make PostPulsar V2 your ultimate
      content operations center.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <!-- Feature 1 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><path d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"></path><path
            d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"></path></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">Content Supercharger</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Transform any blog post, article, or even raw text into engaging social
        media content tailored for multiple platforms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 2 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><path
            d="M12 18.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 7.5 20h-5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 17.5v-11A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 4h19A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 24 6.5v3.5"
          ></path><path d="M16 12.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0v3a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-5 0v-3z"
          ></path><path d="M21 12.5V9"></path><path d="M8 12.5V9"></path><path
            d="M16 12.5h-4"></path></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">Video Transcription</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Automatically extract the full transcript from any YouTube video and use
        it as the source for your next viral posts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 3 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path
            d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">AI-Powered Engine</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Leverage a powerful AI to generate high-quality, contextual, and
        ready-to-publish content, complete with relevant hashtags.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 4 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"></path><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path
            d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"></path><path
            d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path
            d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path><path
            d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">
          Multi-Network Publishing
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Connect your accounts and publish directly to X, Instagram, Facebook,
        LinkedIn, Threads, Telegram, and Discord.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 5 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><circle
            cx="8.5"
            cy="8.5"
            r="1.5"></circle><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"></path></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">Media Support</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Enhance your posts by publishing with single images, carousels, and
        videos to supported networks, all from one dashboard.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 6 -->
    <div class="border border-border/30 bg-background/20 p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="size-8 text-primary"
          ><path
            d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 0 2l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 0-2l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"
          ></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg
        >
        <h3 class="ml-4 text-xl font-bold uppercase">Advanced Controls</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/70">
        Fine-tune your content generation with advanced settings for character
        limits and custom AI prompts to match your brand's voice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
